  - models/flux2.py      diffusion transformer blocks, RoPE, modulation and
                         embedding layers. Modified to add geospatial metadata
                         conditioning with learnable null embeddings and the
                         Geospatial Semantic Alignment projection head.
  - models/vae_flux2.py  autoencoder. The network is used unmodified apart from
                         formatting; checkpoint loading that accepts both the
                         diffusers and the BFL key layout was added.

The released GeoCore-9B weights are Apache-2.0. The DiT is trained from scratch
on Git-10M and is not derived from any FLUX checkpoint.

